# SecForge app-repo template — .dockerignore
#
# Mirrors .gitignore's secret-hostile patterns and adds image-build
# noise reduction. ADR-0013 § Layer 3 (build-time): even if a secret
# slipped past gitleaks, the build context must not carry it into the
# image layer cache.

# === SECRETS — same patterns as .gitignore ===
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
*.jks
*.crt
*.cer

id_rsa
id_rsa.*
id_ecdsa
id_ecdsa.*
id_ed25519
id_ed25519.*

**/credentials.json
**/service-account*.json
.aws/
.gcloud/

# === BUILD-CONTEXT NOISE ===
# Don't ship the build instructions inside the image.
Dockerfile
Dockerfile.*
.dockerignore

# Repo metadata, docs, tests, dev tooling.
.git/
.github/
.gitignore
.gitleaks.toml
.pre-commit-config.yaml
*.md
tests/
test/
node_modules/
coverage.txt
*.test
*.out

# Editor/OS noise.
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
